<title>CANADA: George Weston to redeem second series pfds.</title>
<headline>George Weston to redeem second series pfds.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>George Weston Ltd said on Tuesday it will be redeeming on October 31 all of its outstanding senior preferred shares, second series, at C$105.00 per share plus accrued and unpaid dividends.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
